{"version":1,"content":"<p>據Ars Technica報道，一名英國陸軍士兵在前往愛沙尼亞執行軍事任務前，未遵守上級關於移除手機SIM卡的安全命令，隨後手機遭到黑客入侵，私人裸照被盜並遭到勒索。最終，這名士兵因違反合法軍事命令被軍事法庭判處10個月拘禁，並被降級。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585458.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.655581+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T08:11:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"f037f60eaa8f8bcd97d4fadd0d70903a64d28a6610cb12f49f96fe2861d080fd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}